#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Claude Status Setup — the graphical installer for the per-user part.

The .deb puts the extension and hook on the system. This wizard connects them
to *your* account: it registers the hooks in ~/.claude/settings.json, turns the
extension on, saves your preferences and installs an optional Persian font.

    claude-status-setup              open the wizard
    claude-status-setup --first-run  open it only if setup hasn't been done yet
"""
